#: scenario6:scenario6_CA195F44_E69A_47A7_8596_4880D7E9C30E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7f3413950a52ddab164342a2b64b038ba15a7e0cf296370393caf7d0160637c
